vent ledger and runtime evidence independently as UID 994/GID 985\n\nTracks #1552\n\n## Runtime outcome\n\n- dependency PR #1560 merged and `origin/main@975d36b0af53d301cacf41f29403e9cc37b760f3` readback passed before rebase/execution\n- source governed: 175 unique objects\n- E1 observations: 55\n- sealed observations: 120, commitment only in Git\n- A-02 ledger events: seq 762-765; full-chain head `f215c87addfd3207fa52064966d544b34197d3cfab8921549a9726a889ecaff2`\n- maker/reviewer containers: network none, provider calls 0, remote writes 0, checker/full-repo visibility absent, cross-read violations 0\n- stale root-owned v2 checkpoint quarantined byte-for-byte with a metadata-only receipt before the fresh UID-995 run\n- independent runtime validation: PASS, 0 critical defects\n\nA post-runtime control-plane attempt to resolve an unavailable Docker image failed before download. It did not affect the network-none maker/reviewer runtimes, provider-call count, durable outputs, or remote-write count; the offline reviewed runtime path was then used.\n\n## Git-safe evidence\n\n- `e1-maker-collection.v3.json`\n- `input-commitment.v1.json`\n- `maker-run-receipt.v3.json`\n- `runtime-evidence.v1.json`\n\nThe sealed collection remains only under restricted durable custody and is not committed.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `NODE_PATH=/home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules node --test tests/vlm/campaign_a_a02_pdf_source_v1.test.mjs` — 18 passed\n- `python3 -m unittest tests.vlm.test_validate_9709_campaign_a_a02_maker_v3` — 12 passed\n- JSON Schema validation for the Git-safe E1 collection and run receipt — 2 passed\n- exact UID-994 validator — PASS (`e1=55`, `sealed=120`, `unique=175`, `critical_defects=0`)\n- Git-safe leak scan — PASS (`sealed_plaintext_files=0`)\n- Node syntax, Python compile, `git diff --check` — PASS\n\n## Review posture\n\nCurrent candidate head: `c99c5ed354f72143295f8349d0de36e70de72d70`.\n\nPR remains Draft pending fresh exact-head independent review and fresh CI. No tooling-only or self-reviewed merge is requested.\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-15T03:20:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T05:52:14Z","closed_at":"2026-07-15T05:43:25Z","merged_at":"2026-07-15T05:43:25Z","merge_commit_sha":"f0d4fd79872b904afc655e191f0853cfa04f1590","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1561/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1561/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1561/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/c99c5ed354f72143295f8349d0de36e70de72d70","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1552","ref":"feat/issue-1552","sha":"c99c5ed354f72143295f8349d0de36e70de72d70","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":999357095,"node_id":"R_kgDOO5D6pw","name